    "term_desc": "PART 6&lt;br /&gt;Directions: Read the texts that follow. A word, phrase, or sentence is missing in parts of each text.&lt;br /&gt;Four answer choices for each question are given below the text. Select the best answer to complete the text. Then mark the letter (A), (B), (C), or (D) on your answer sheet.&lt;br /&gt;",
